WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:14.893
Okokuqala, amangqamuzana aphilayo asebenzisa ama-triplets angu-64 ukuze agcine imithetho yokusinda, futhi amatafula okuhlola angena ngamathuluzi ayisithupha asebenzisa ama-switch angu-64 afanayo.

2
00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:27.023
Okwesibili, ukuqoqa izilungiselelo zokushintsha ezine ezakhelene ndawonye kuthatha amaphutha amancane ezinzwa noma amagama kuyilapho kuqeda umsindo ophansi womsindo ophakeme.

3
00:00:27.363 --> 00:00:46.845
Okwesithathu, i-core engamakhilobhayithi angu-16 isebenzisa amakhono aqinisekisiwe ngemizuzwana emincane, kusukela kuma-microcontroller asezingeni eliphansi kakhulu kuya kumakhadi wesifunda e-M.2 angenawo umoya, avuse amamodeli amakhulu kuphela uma kukhona okusha ngempela.
